### REST Client — S7.3 Azure API Management.
### Lógica del gateway (policies, versionado, tier) — pura, sin Azure.

@host = http://localhost:5098

### Salud (público)
GET {{host}}/health

### Policy OK — key + jwt válido, sin pasarse de rate limit (slide 5/9)
POST {{host}}/apim/policy
Content-Type: application/json

{ "contexto": { "subscriptionKey": "abc123", "ip": "10.0.0.5", "jwtAudience": "client-1", "llamadasEnVentana": 10 },
  "config": { "subscriptionRequired": true, "requiredAudience": "client-1" } }

### Policy 401 — falta subscription key (slide 8)
POST {{host}}/apim/policy
Content-Type: application/json

{ "contexto": { "ip": "10.0.0.5" }, "config": { "subscriptionRequired": true } }

### Policy 429 — rate limit superado, estándar (slide 9)
POST {{host}}/apim/policy
Content-Type: application/json

{ "contexto": { "subscriptionKey": "k", "ip": "1.1.1.1", "llamadasEnVentana": 100 },
  "config": { "subscriptionRequired": true, "rateLimitCalls": 100 } }

### Policy 200 — premium aguanta 1000 (slide 9)
POST {{host}}/apim/policy
Content-Type: application/json

{ "contexto": { "subscriptionKey": "k", "ip": "1.1.1.1", "userTier": "premium", "llamadasEnVentana": 500 },
  "config": { "subscriptionRequired": true, "rateLimitCalls": 100, "rateLimitCallsPremium": 1000 } }

### Policy 403 — IP en blacklist (slide 6)
POST {{host}}/apim/policy
Content-Type: application/json

{ "contexto": { "subscriptionKey": "k", "ip": "9.9.9.9" },
  "config": { "subscriptionRequired": true, "ipBlacklist": ["9.9.9.9"] } }

### Circuit breaker: 503 e intento 1 de 3 → reintentar (slide 18)
GET {{host}}/apim/retry?statusBackend=503&intentos=1&maxIntentos=3

### Versionado Segment (recomendado, slide 7)
GET {{host}}/apim/version?esquema=Segment&apiPath=productos&entrada=/v2/productos/123&versiones=v1,v2

### Versionado Header (slide 7)
GET {{host}}/apim/version?esquema=Header&apiPath=productos&entrada=v1&versiones=v1,v2

### Esquema recomendado (slide 7)
GET {{host}}/apim/version/recomendado

### Tier: VNet → Premium (slide 32)
POST {{host}}/apim/tier
Content-Type: application/json

{ "produccion": true, "requiereVNet": true }

### Tier: bajo volumen sin requisitos → Consumption (slide 3)
POST {{host}}/apim/tier
Content-Type: application/json

{ "llamadasMes": 50000 }

### ¿Buen caso para APIM? (slide 16)
POST {{host}}/apim/caso
Content-Type: application/json

{ "multiplesApis": true, "necesitaRateLimitOCache": true, "exponeATerceros": true }

### Plan + checklist del entregable
POST {{host}}/apim/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{ "escenario": { "produccion": true, "requiereVNet": true },
  "uso": { "multiplesApis": true, "necesitaRateLimitOCache": true, "versionadoCentral": true } }
